---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About | Eshin Griffith"
  description="About Eshin Griffith, an Atlanta-based senior software engineer and technical lead with a background in applied mathematics."
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="prompt"><span aria-hidden="true">$</span> cat about.txt</p>
    <h1>About Eshin</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      I’m an Atlanta-based senior software engineer and technical lead. I build
      TypeScript backend platforms, AI agent systems, API integrations, and AWS
      infrastructure with an emphasis on typed, testable systems.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <section class="panel story" aria-labelledby="path-heading">
      <p class="panel-label">career path</p>
      <h2 id="path-heading">From a first website to production platforms</h2>
      <p>
        My path into software began by maintaining the website for Candlelight
        String Quartet. That practical start led to internships and then a
        full-time role at <a href="https://kollacode.com">Kollacode</a>, where I
        grew into technical leadership while building enterprise ETL systems,
        APIs, and performance-sensitive web applications.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today at ChiroHD, I serve as a Senior Software Engineer and Alina’s
        primary technical decision-maker. I lead four engineers and work across
        product, go-to-market, support, and executive teams to carry a voice
        scheduling platform from system design through production operations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="education-heading">
      <p class="panel-label">education</p>
      <h2 id="education-heading">Applied Mathematics</h2>
      <p>
        I earned a Bachelor of Science in Applied Mathematics from Kennesaw
        State University. That background still shapes how I approach systems:
        define the model, make assumptions visible, and test what matters.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="outside-heading">
      <p class="panel-label">away from the keyboard</p>
      <h2 id="outside-heading">Reading and games</h2>
      <p>
        Outside work, I enjoy reading and playing both digital and tabletop
        games.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }

  .story {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .panel h2 {
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.6rem);
  }

  .panel p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 38rem) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
